# RFX OS API rail -> Netlify Function (Blob-backed)
# The OS frontend fetches relative `api/...` paths; System A POSTs to
# /os/api/handoff. Both land on the same function, which serves the
# original URL (200 rewrite) so the browser never sees a redirect.
/os/api/*  /.netlify/functions/osapi/:splat  200
/api/*     /.netlify/functions/osapi/:splat  200
